# Files that are not needed to build or run the site. Only used when you upload the folder with the Vercel CLI or by drag-and-drop;
# a GitHub-connected deploy builds from the repository as it is.
# Every pattern starts with "/" so it only matches the top-level folder. Without it, "supabase" would also remove
# src/lib/supabase and "tools" would remove src/lib/agent/tools, which the build needs.
/.claude
/tools
/docs
/tests
/supabase
/scripts
/.github
/*.md
!/README.md
